gowt is a Go translation of Eclipse SWT (https://github.com/eclipse-platform/eclipse.platform.swt),
source commit af630a9093 (SWT); org.eclipse.jface.* comes from eclipse.platform.ui, commit 618d26a101.

SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0

Copyright notices of the original authors are kept in the header of every translated file.

icons/lucide embeds a subset of Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), ISC License, partly derived from
Feather (MIT); the full text is in icons/lucide/LICENSE. System icon sets (SF Symbols, Segoe Fluent
Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets, freedesktop themes) are read from the operating system at run time and are
not part of this repository.
